MERGE (m:Mod {mod_id: "ResearchLabInternProfession"}) SET m.name = "Zombie Virus Vaccine: Research Lab Intern Profession [B42.13+ SP/MP]", m.version = "2.0", m.author = "rEXX", m.pz_version = "42.13", m.description = "<SIZE:medium><LEFT><RGB:1,0.8,0.4>RESEARCH LABORATORY INTERN PROFESSION <LINE><LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small><RGB:0.9,0.9,0.9>When things went south, you were smart enough to grab every scientific research document you could find and get out. <LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small>You forgot to grab a pistol, though. <LINE><LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small><RGB:0.6,1,0.8>You may not have the skills to build all equipment and develop a cure on your own, but you already know all the procedures <LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small><RGB:0.7,1,0.7>Designed exclusively for the Zombie Virus Vaccine mod. <LINE><LEFT>";
MERGE (m:Mod {mod_id: "ZVirusVaccine42BETA"}) SET m.name = "Zombie Virus Vaccine [B42.13-15+ SP/MP]", m.version = "3.0", m.author = "Demonius, Dr_Reapers, Ehue232v, HuaGreanDEV, rEXX", m.pz_version = "42.14", m.description = "<SIZE:medium><LEFT><RGB:1,0.8,0.4>ZOMBIE VIRUS VACCINE [B42.13+ SP/MP] <LINE><LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small><RGB:0.9,0.9,0.9>Obviously, the logical solution to a zombie apocalypse is to set up a full laboratory in your backyard and start poking around in contaminated blood. <LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small>Build questionable equipment, perform autopsies with dubiously sourced tools, synthesize compounds that probably shouldn’t be anywhere near fire, and try to develop a cure before your closest volunteer decides to take a bite out of you. <LINE><LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small><RGB:1,0.35,0.25>DISCLAIMER: <LINE><LEFT><SIZE:small><RGB:0.6,1,0.8><SIZE:small><LEFT><RGB:1,0.8,0.4>I am not the original author of this mod — I only updated it for Build 42. <LINE><LEFT>After a full year since the unstable B42 release, I noticed that this mod was still unavailable. Personally, I consider it one of the best mods ever made, so I decided to update it myself. If the original author requests removal, I will take it down. For now, I intend to keep it updated as much as possible. <LINE><LINE><LEFT><RGB:1,0.35,0.25>DOES NOT REQUIRE PROFESSION MOD TO WORK!";
MERGE (m:Mod {mod_id: "TombWardrobeALTVanilla"}) SET m.name = "Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative [VANILLA]", m.version = "", m.author = "Tomb", m.pz_version = "", m.description = "Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative Pack - B42 [VANILLA]";
MERGE (m:Mod {mod_id: "TombWardrobeALT"}) SET m.name = "Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative", m.version = "", m.author = "Tomb", m.pz_version = "", m.description = "Tomb's Wardrobe - Alternative Pack - B42";
